1
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:31,919
=Remnants of Gold=

2
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:34,478
(Adapted from Gu Long's
"Flying Eagle over the Great Land")

3
00:01:34,479 --> 00:01:37,540
(The main characters
in this drama are fictional)

4
00:01:38,220 --> 00:01:40,460
=Episode 11=

5
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,079
General Ha.

6
00:01:45,079 --> 00:01:46,519
The Officer is no match for him.

7
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:49,359
I am a seventh-rank imperial
Embroidered Uniform Guard officer.

8
00:01:49,600 --> 00:01:51,760
Have the twelve guards of
Gan-Liang all rebelled?

9
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,879
Arrest this jerk!

10
00:02:15,536 --> 00:02:16,144
General Ha!

11
00:02:16,150 --> 00:02:17,000
Are you okay, Officer?

12
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,719
Should we capture Tie Futu first?

13
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:25,960
Ha Bingzhong!

14
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:28,919
What are you all afraid of?

15
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:30,520
What's there to fear?

16
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,039
Everyone, look!

17
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,639
Every last one of you, look!

18
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:44,800
General Ha.

19
00:02:52,528 --> 00:02:54,736
You dare trample
an Embroidered Uniform Guard officer?

20
00:02:55,319 --> 00:02:56,439
You're finished.

21
00:03:03,199 --> 00:03:03,759
You...

22
00:03:18,039 --> 00:03:18,840
General Ha.

23
00:03:18,928 --> 00:03:20,260
If an imperial officer dies here

24
00:03:20,270 --> 00:03:21,970
and the imperial court
holds us accountable,

25
00:03:21,984 --> 00:03:23,024
what will the General do?

26
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:51,360
Die, you scoundrel!

27
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,560
Everyone, disperse.

28
00:04:50,879 --> 00:04:52,439
Carry the body out.

29
00:04:53,759 --> 00:04:54,399
Yes.

30
00:04:56,839 --> 00:04:58,560
This is outrageous.

31
00:05:08,879 --> 00:05:09,439
Stop.

32
00:05:09,639 --> 00:05:10,399
Move aside!

33
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:12,528
Officer Pu, please don't
make things harder for us.

34
00:05:13,968 --> 00:05:15,870
With all this fighting
on the drill ground,

35
00:05:16,199 --> 00:05:18,240
can't the Commander-in-Chief
hear it from inside?

36
00:05:18,528 --> 00:05:21,430
The Commander-in-Chief hasn't left
the rear courtyard for three months.

37
00:05:21,879 --> 00:05:23,319
General Ha has given orders.

38
00:05:23,439 --> 00:05:25,279
Trespassers will be executed.

39
00:05:26,319 --> 00:05:28,279
Guerrilla Commander Ha Bingzhong.

40
00:05:28,519 --> 00:05:30,759
Even if a scoundrel takes my life,

41
00:05:31,399 --> 00:05:32,720
is he the one rebelling,

42
00:05:33,279 --> 00:05:35,319
or have all of you rebelled?

43
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:47,040
Where is Ha Bingzhong?

44
00:06:22,959 --> 00:06:24,199
Take the body away.

45
00:06:24,519 --> 00:06:25,920
Everyone, return to your posts.

46
00:07:02,620 --> 00:07:07,340
(Camel Bell Inn)

47
00:07:32,496 --> 00:07:34,160
I'm here to see the Commander-in-Chief.

48
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,360
Please pass along a message.

49
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:43,439
I'm here to tell the General

50
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:46,839
where 300,000 taels of gold
are buried in the great desert.

51
00:07:47,420 --> 00:07:51,340
(Shaanxi Branch
Regional Military Commission)

52
00:08:25,319 --> 00:08:26,439
Do you have any water?

53
00:08:27,519 --> 00:08:28,800
Could I have a cup?

54
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:31,120
I've come all this way

55
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:32,528
without finding a drop of water.

56
00:08:42,279 --> 00:08:43,279
I'll wait there.

57
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,159
Tell the General

58
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:48,639
that my name is Zhang Luyao.

59
00:09:01,919 --> 00:09:02,600
Drink up.

60
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:08,799
- Double.
- Single.

61
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:10,320
(Sancang Terrace)

62
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,360
What's this?

63
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:13,080
Drinking.

64
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,200
Another round?

65
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:18,879
Again.

66
00:09:18,879 --> 00:09:19,639
Come on.

67
00:09:19,639 --> 00:09:20,639
I refuse to believe this.

68
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:22,679
Fill it up.

69
00:09:22,679 --> 00:09:23,480
Come on, keep going.

70
00:09:23,759 --> 00:09:29,759
- Single.
- Double.

71
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,440
What would you like?

72
00:09:42,639 --> 00:09:43,759
A cup of water.

73
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:46,120
Just water?

74
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:49,279
I'm out of money.

75
00:09:54,399 --> 00:09:58,919
- Single.
- Double.

76
00:09:59,039 --> 00:09:59,679
Lady,

77
00:09:59,679 --> 00:10:01,440
water costs money here, too.

78
00:10:04,039 --> 00:10:05,279
The water here isn't good.

79
00:10:05,559 --> 00:10:06,519
Have some of ours.

80
00:10:06,759 --> 00:10:07,759
It's on us.

81
00:10:25,799 --> 00:10:27,200
You brought your own water?

82
00:10:27,648 --> 00:10:28,840
Out here in the great desert,

83
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:30,879
who wouldn't bring their own water?

84
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,120
Our water

85
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:33,080
is the best.

86
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:43,879
Your name is Zhang Luyao?

87
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:47,840
How did you know?

88
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,064
I heard you talking

89
00:10:50,112 --> 00:10:52,960
to the men from the Regional Military
Commission Yamen by the road.

90
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:54,600
My hearing

91
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:55,840
is also the best.

92
00:11:03,399 --> 00:11:04,039
Thank you.

93
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:07,240
What's your name?

94
00:11:09,279 --> 00:11:10,279
I'm Yan.

95
00:11:10,879 --> 00:11:12,080
This is my man.

96
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:17,720
You're drinking the water we gave you.

97
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:20,039
Aren't you afraid it's poisoned?

98
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:25,200
I am immune to all poisons.

99
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:27,360
Didn't you know?

100
00:11:28,919 --> 00:11:30,559
Now we do.

101
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:33,080
But there's no poison in this water.

102
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:35,200
It's from Mount Pingfeng.

103
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:36,720
Yan gave you

104
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:39,320
the last of it.

105
00:11:39,480 --> 00:11:40,279
Thank you.

106
00:12:27,150 --> 00:12:28,336
Why are you following me?

107
00:12:28,384 --> 00:12:30,320
We're worried something else
might happen to you.

108
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:31,559
Now you're worried?

109
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:52,080
Where is Ha Bingzhong?

110
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,000
Right here.

111
00:13:30,159 --> 00:13:31,320
Close the door.

112
00:13:31,879 --> 00:13:33,720
I need to speak with Officer Pu.

113
00:13:56,720 --> 00:13:57,879
Going somewhere?

114
00:13:58,480 --> 00:14:00,159
With all that gold, silver, and jewelry,

115
00:14:00,279 --> 00:14:01,279
you must be going far.

116
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:04,120
I'm not going anywhere.

117
00:14:04,679 --> 00:14:06,759
I'm staying right here,
and waiting for you.

118
00:14:13,759 --> 00:14:15,399
You've got some nerve.

119
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:30,799
I joined the army
in the eighth year of Hongwu.

120
00:14:31,639 --> 00:14:33,279
From Shaanxi to Gansu,

121
00:14:33,759 --> 00:14:35,080
I followed the General

122
00:14:35,136 --> 00:14:37,150
through more than
a dozen battles, large and small.

123
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:40,600
As for courage,

124
00:14:41,080 --> 00:14:42,639
I've always had plenty.

125
00:14:42,799 --> 00:14:44,120
More than enough.

126
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:46,320
I came from the Capital to Liangzhou.

127
00:14:46,320 --> 00:14:48,448
My investigation led me all the way
to the Yamen.

128
00:14:48,679 --> 00:14:49,879
Tie Futu

129
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:52,279
was right by your side.

130
00:14:54,759 --> 00:14:56,240
Tie Futu is dead.

131
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:58,440
Officer Pu,

132
00:14:58,799 --> 00:15:00,279
what case are you investigating?

133
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:04,159
You killed Tie Futu to silence him.

134
00:15:04,519 --> 00:15:06,360
Silencing him
made things easier for everyone.

135
00:15:06,879 --> 00:15:09,279
But you tried to have Tie Futu kill me.

136
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:12,039
The plan was

137
00:15:12,480 --> 00:15:15,000
for Officer Pu
to be killed by a criminal,

138
00:15:15,759 --> 00:15:18,840
and then for that criminal to be killed
by the warriors of this residence.

139
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:20,480
That would have closed the case.

140
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:21,840
Unfortunately, I survived.

141
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:24,200
And your warriors don't dare touch me.

142
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:29,519
So perhaps you can now tell me

143
00:15:29,519 --> 00:15:31,039
what you really want.

144
00:15:34,120 --> 00:15:35,840
What I really want?

145
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:40,799
How do we close this case?

146
00:15:42,759 --> 00:15:43,879
What will it take

147
00:15:44,080 --> 00:15:45,799
for you

148
00:15:46,519 --> 00:15:48,240
to leave the Ganzhou Guard?

149
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:04,879
Interesting.

150
00:16:05,879 --> 00:16:07,200
Very interesting.

151
00:16:15,879 --> 00:16:18,639
Liangzhou has been interesting
since the day I arrived.

152
00:16:18,919 --> 00:16:20,759
If you can kill me, you do.

153
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:21,799
If you can't,

154
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:23,320
you negotiate.

155
00:16:23,519 --> 00:16:24,159
Is that it?

156
00:16:29,280 --> 00:16:31,150
The great desert
is harsh and unforgiving.

157
00:16:31,879 --> 00:16:33,679
People here speak and act

158
00:16:34,120 --> 00:16:35,799
differently from those in the Capital.

159
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:38,039
They don't beat around the bush.

160
00:16:38,039 --> 00:16:40,279
But I'm here
to see the Commander-in-Chief.

161
00:16:40,799 --> 00:16:41,519
You

162
00:16:42,039 --> 00:16:43,480
are only a guerrilla commander.

163
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:52,600
The Commander-in-Chief

164
00:16:55,759 --> 00:16:57,639
isn't nearly as restrained.

165
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:01,159
Officer Pu,

166
00:17:02,279 --> 00:17:04,640
you should leave yourself
a way out too, shouldn't you?

167
00:17:06,839 --> 00:17:08,000
Talk to me first.

168
00:17:08,624 --> 00:17:09,830
If we can't come to terms,

169
00:17:10,799 --> 00:17:12,519
then you can see the Commander-in-Chief.

170
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:19,519
Can you make decisions
for the Commander-in-Chief?

171
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:28,079
Officer Pu,

172
00:17:28,559 --> 00:17:31,039
now you've
finally said something sensible.

173
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:36,440
No one can make decisions
for the General.

174
00:17:37,279 --> 00:17:38,200
But everyone

175
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:40,680
can make their own decisions.

176
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:43,759
Then what decision
did you make for yourself?

177
00:17:46,400 --> 00:17:47,960
Enough talk.

178
00:18:03,559 --> 00:18:04,839
When there's little gold,

179
00:18:05,559 --> 00:18:07,440
it's just gold.

180
00:18:08,559 --> 00:18:09,880
But when there's enough,

181
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:12,440
it can decide things for us.

182
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:18,599
It's almost dark.

183
00:18:18,799 --> 00:18:20,400
Luyao, what are you waiting for?

184
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:25,960
I'm waiting for someone to take me
into the Yamen.

185
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:28,920
We can help you.

186
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:30,160
Thank you.

187
00:18:31,599 --> 00:18:33,039
I don't need any help.

188
00:18:34,279 --> 00:18:36,039
Didn't your whole family die?

189
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:38,480
We can kill Tie Futu.

190
00:18:38,680 --> 00:18:39,960
It'd be easy.

191
00:18:45,839 --> 00:18:47,079
How much do you know?

192
00:18:50,599 --> 00:18:52,799
We want to know what you know.

193
00:18:53,839 --> 00:18:54,839
For example,

194
00:18:55,119 --> 00:18:57,039
where are those 300,000 taels of gold

195
00:18:57,640 --> 00:18:58,759
hidden?

196
00:19:02,460 --> 00:19:04,900
(Shaanxi Branch
Regional Military Commission)

197
00:19:35,200 --> 00:19:36,240
How much is there?

198
00:19:36,799 --> 00:19:38,440
I haven't counted carefully.

199
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:41,759
About

200
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:43,319
1,200 taels of gold.

201
00:19:43,960 --> 00:19:45,079
And

202
00:19:45,279 --> 00:19:46,640
870 taels of silver.

203
00:19:47,240 --> 00:19:48,319
Is it all yours?

204
00:19:51,319 --> 00:19:52,599
It all belongs to the General.

205
00:19:52,599 --> 00:19:55,839
When there's enough gold,
it can decide things for us.

206
00:19:56,039 --> 00:19:58,000
So is this

207
00:19:58,279 --> 00:19:59,480
enough or not?

208
00:20:02,240 --> 00:20:03,759
It's quite a fortune already.

209
00:20:08,319 --> 00:20:10,119
How do you think

210
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:12,160
we should close the case?

211
00:20:13,079 --> 00:20:15,839
What will make me
leave the Ganzhou Guard?

212
00:20:29,160 --> 00:20:30,119
This

213
00:20:30,960 --> 00:20:32,279
won't close the case.

214
00:20:34,599 --> 00:20:36,160
And I won't leave, either.

215
00:20:36,599 --> 00:20:37,599
Officer Pu,

216
00:20:37,759 --> 00:20:39,119
there are probably

217
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:41,359
over 700 taels of gold here.

218
00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:44,920
Take this gold back to the Capital,

219
00:20:45,400 --> 00:20:48,000
and you'll have enough wealth
to last half a lifetime.

220
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:02,200
Do the 27 lives
of the Zhang family mean nothing?

221
00:21:05,359 --> 00:21:08,799
The General commands thousands of troops
guarding the northern frontier.

222
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:10,160
The Zhang family

223
00:21:10,440 --> 00:21:12,319
were merely commoners.

224
00:21:12,319 --> 00:21:14,720
The lives of commoners still count.

225
00:21:14,768 --> 00:21:16,000
That account can't be settled?

226
00:21:16,020 --> 00:21:16,960
If we can't settle it,

227
00:21:16,960 --> 00:21:18,599
I'll call in the warriors outside

228
00:21:18,600 --> 00:21:19,810
and we'll settle it together.

229
00:21:21,160 --> 00:21:22,559
Then tell me, Officer Pu,

230
00:21:22,880 --> 00:21:23,839
how should we settle it?

231
00:21:41,720 --> 00:21:42,960
What about my share?

232
00:21:43,480 --> 00:21:44,279
You

233
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:45,759
get nothing.

234
00:21:52,799 --> 00:21:53,400
Fine.

235
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:55,039
Fine.

236
00:22:00,799 --> 00:22:01,759
Gold,

237
00:22:02,440 --> 00:22:03,960
1,200 taels.

238
00:22:04,880 --> 00:22:05,720
Silver,

239
00:22:05,960 --> 00:22:07,519
870 taels.

240
00:22:08,839 --> 00:22:09,759
Officer Pu,

241
00:22:10,359 --> 00:22:11,680
pack them up well.

242
00:22:11,960 --> 00:22:13,079
I'll

243
00:22:13,240 --> 00:22:14,920
have the men outside

244
00:22:14,920 --> 00:22:17,720
prepare a fast horse
for your return to the Capital.

245
00:22:17,720 --> 00:22:18,880
I still need a written record.

246
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:19,759
A record of what?

247
00:22:20,519 --> 00:22:22,519
How much gold and silver there is,

248
00:22:22,880 --> 00:22:24,240
whose gold and silver it is,

249
00:22:24,240 --> 00:22:25,759
and why it's being given to me.

250
00:22:29,799 --> 00:22:30,680
Officer Pu,

251
00:22:33,000 --> 00:22:34,839
you must be joking.

252
00:22:34,839 --> 00:22:38,000
The Commander-in-Chief of Gansu
holds great power and authority.

253
00:22:38,200 --> 00:22:40,599
I'm only a lowly Banner Commander.

254
00:22:41,119 --> 00:22:44,079
What if you accuse me
of wrongdoing later?

255
00:22:44,240 --> 00:22:46,960
With the amount
and reason clearly written down,

256
00:22:47,119 --> 00:22:49,880
I'll dare to enjoy my wealth
when I return to the Capital.

257
00:22:54,920 --> 00:22:55,880
Officer Pu,

258
00:22:56,359 --> 00:22:57,279
you don't trust me?

259
00:22:57,279 --> 00:22:59,039
How could I trust

260
00:22:59,440 --> 00:23:00,359
a pack of scoundrels?

261
00:23:01,799 --> 00:23:02,519
Write it.

262
00:23:04,359 --> 00:23:05,440
If you won't,

263
00:23:05,440 --> 00:23:08,079
I'll have the warriors outside
come in and write it.

264
00:23:16,000 --> 00:23:17,359
There's no ink or inkstone.

265
00:23:21,280 --> 00:23:22,720
Bring the brush, ink, and inkstone.

266
00:23:27,200 --> 00:23:27,839
Hurry.

267
00:23:39,799 --> 00:23:40,960
May I sit here?

268
00:23:44,160 --> 00:23:44,839
Go ahead.

269
00:23:53,640 --> 00:23:55,319
Since you know Tie Futu,

270
00:23:56,240 --> 00:23:57,480
why didn't you ask him

271
00:23:58,000 --> 00:23:59,279
where the gold is?

272
00:23:59,440 --> 00:24:01,960
You said the gold was at
the Regional Military Commission Yamen.

273
00:24:02,359 --> 00:24:04,000
Only Tie Futu would believe that.

274
00:24:09,472 --> 00:24:10,750
He didn't believe it, either.

275
00:24:11,824 --> 00:24:13,440
But he didn't know where else to go,

276
00:24:13,824 --> 00:24:15,440
so he had no choice but to come back

277
00:24:15,456 --> 00:24:16,990
and settle things with his accomplices.

278
00:24:17,759 --> 00:24:19,279
Tie Futu's accomplices?

279
00:24:19,839 --> 00:24:20,599
Who?

280
00:24:28,799 --> 00:24:30,400
The Commander-in-Chief of Gansu,

281
00:24:31,680 --> 00:24:32,799
General Pingxi.

282
00:24:50,279 --> 00:24:51,359
Do you have any more water?

283
00:24:54,440 --> 00:24:56,799
So you're waiting here
for them to take you inside,

284
00:24:57,240 --> 00:24:59,079
then you'll kill Tie Futu

285
00:24:59,279 --> 00:25:00,519
and the Commander-in-Chief, too.

286
00:25:01,319 --> 00:25:02,519
If you have any more water,

287
00:25:03,440 --> 00:25:05,119
could I have some?

288
00:25:07,160 --> 00:25:08,079
Luyao,

289
00:25:08,920 --> 00:25:10,400
if something can't be done,

290
00:25:10,519 --> 00:25:11,359
then let it go.

291
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:13,400
Life

292
00:25:13,799 --> 00:25:15,079
doesn't have to be so hard.

293
00:25:17,319 --> 00:25:18,720
There's a kind of bird in Shu

294
00:25:18,912 --> 00:25:20,960
that spends
its whole life flying through the sky.

295
00:25:21,632 --> 00:25:22,830
As long as it keeps flying,

296
00:25:24,359 --> 00:25:25,680
it never knows hardship.

297
00:25:26,720 --> 00:25:28,799
So you do know

298
00:25:28,920 --> 00:25:30,880
where those 300,000 taels
of gold are, don't you?

299
00:25:32,319 --> 00:25:32,960
Yes.

300
00:25:34,559 --> 00:25:35,839
Don't you want it for yourself?

301
00:25:42,359 --> 00:25:43,759
People like you

302
00:25:45,119 --> 00:25:46,240
are the ones who suffer.

303
00:25:47,119 --> 00:25:48,480
We don't suffer.

304
00:25:50,920 --> 00:25:51,839
How pitiful.

305
00:25:52,279 --> 00:25:52,920
What?

306
00:25:53,079 --> 00:25:54,119
You look down on us?

307
00:25:54,759 --> 00:25:56,640
You think you're so special?

308
00:27:30,960 --> 00:27:32,440
I'll dictate. You write.

309
00:27:36,400 --> 00:27:37,440
Officer Pu,

310
00:27:38,039 --> 00:27:39,599
don't push this too far.

311
00:27:39,599 --> 00:27:41,039
And what if I do?

312
00:27:41,680 --> 00:27:44,079
You'll lose everything
and end up with nothing, right?

313
00:27:44,839 --> 00:27:47,039
Start writing,
and we'll see if I've gone too far.

314
00:27:57,720 --> 00:27:59,440
What do you expect me to write?

315
00:28:05,559 --> 00:28:07,440
The Commander-in-Chief of Gansu

316
00:28:07,720 --> 00:28:10,000
and Guerrilla Commander Ha Bingzhong,

317
00:28:10,880 --> 00:28:13,640
in their search for gold
from the previous dynasty...

318
00:28:19,160 --> 00:28:19,920
Write.

319
00:28:42,480 --> 00:28:43,200
Write!

320
00:28:44,030 --> 00:28:45,872
Poisoned 27 members of the Zhang family,

321
00:28:45,904 --> 00:28:47,880
residents of Liangzhou
under their jurisdiction,

322
00:28:47,880 --> 00:28:49,984
and plotted to murder Pu Ying
of the Embroidered Uniform Guard,

323
00:28:50,000 --> 00:28:51,160
who was investigating the case.

324
00:28:51,160 --> 00:28:53,319
After their crimes were exposed,
to escape punishment,

325
00:28:53,319 --> 00:28:55,880
the Commander-in-Chief of Gansu
and Guerrilla Commander Ha Bingzhong

326
00:28:55,880 --> 00:28:58,416
(Commander-in-Chief of Gansu)
offered 1,200 taels of gold

327
00:28:58,448 --> 00:28:59,920
and 870 taels of silver

328
00:28:59,920 --> 00:29:01,640
as a bribe.

329
00:29:04,039 --> 00:29:05,319
Why did you stop writing?

330
00:29:09,559 --> 00:29:10,920
I almost forgot.

331
00:29:14,359 --> 00:29:17,319
I also have 100 taels of gold here.

332
00:29:18,799 --> 00:29:21,160
You issued the Zhang
Escort Agency's escort contract.

333
00:29:21,559 --> 00:29:22,519
The escort fee

334
00:29:22,680 --> 00:29:23,960
is also illicit money.

335
00:29:24,592 --> 00:29:27,270
So that makes 1,300 taels of gold
offered by the Commander-in-Chief

336
00:29:27,279 --> 00:29:30,240
of Gansu
and Guerrilla Commander Ha Bingzhong,

337
00:29:30,400 --> 00:29:32,799
plus 870 taels of silver.

338
00:29:33,359 --> 00:29:34,279
Write.

339
00:29:40,119 --> 00:29:41,000
Officer Pu,

340
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:43,240
I never thought

341
00:29:44,359 --> 00:29:45,599
you were this kind of man.

342
00:29:46,200 --> 00:29:47,599
Neither did I.

343
00:29:50,519 --> 00:29:52,319
Is there really no room to settle this?

344
00:29:56,680 --> 00:29:58,160
To tell you the truth,

345
00:29:59,519 --> 00:30:02,160
there might have been.

346
00:30:03,839 --> 00:30:07,839
Do you know why the poisoned victims
killed one another?

347
00:30:09,519 --> 00:30:10,680
You know?

348
00:30:11,240 --> 00:30:14,200
The poison you used
on the Zhang family poisoned me, too.

349
00:30:14,519 --> 00:30:15,920
When the poison took hold,

350
00:30:15,920 --> 00:30:18,000
you looked like an evil spirit to me,

351
00:30:18,240 --> 00:30:19,839
and I looked the same to you.

352
00:30:20,016 --> 00:30:22,240
Everyone thought
they saw evil spirits killing people,

353
00:30:22,240 --> 00:30:24,359
so they all tried
to kill those evil spirits.

354
00:30:25,920 --> 00:30:28,000
Then how did you survive?

355
00:30:32,960 --> 00:30:34,279
At the Zhang Escort Agency,

356
00:30:35,319 --> 00:30:36,799
I came back from the brink of death.

357
00:30:39,559 --> 00:30:40,759
When I opened my eyes,

358
00:30:41,160 --> 00:30:42,279
the evil spirits were gone.

359
00:30:43,519 --> 00:30:46,599
Instead, I saw a woman
who looked like a divine being.

360
00:30:46,599 --> 00:30:47,720
Zhang Luyao.

361
00:30:51,880 --> 00:30:52,960
Can you see me?

362
00:30:56,279 --> 00:30:57,799
It felt like a dream.

363
00:31:01,440 --> 00:31:03,079
If not for the gold,

364
00:31:04,359 --> 00:31:05,640
we never would have met

365
00:31:07,279 --> 00:31:08,799
in this lifetime.

366
00:31:12,720 --> 00:31:14,640
That's why
there's no room to settle this.

367
00:31:14,920 --> 00:31:15,720
Understand?

368
00:31:17,319 --> 00:31:19,200
That woman
who looked like a divine being.

369
00:31:21,200 --> 00:31:22,359
I understand.

370
00:31:25,599 --> 00:31:27,359
Of all the mistakes we made,

371
00:31:28,839 --> 00:31:31,759
we never should've
let that Zhang lady come back.

372
00:31:33,640 --> 00:31:34,960
So does she know

373
00:31:34,960 --> 00:31:36,920
where those 300,000 taels

374
00:31:37,440 --> 00:31:39,079
of gold are now?

375
00:31:40,559 --> 00:31:42,039
If she wants to know,

376
00:31:42,240 --> 00:31:43,559
she'll find out.

377
00:31:56,960 --> 00:31:58,359
The General

378
00:31:59,160 --> 00:32:00,440
should be waking up soon.

379
00:32:22,039 --> 00:32:23,839
Since there's no room to settle this,

380
00:32:25,720 --> 00:32:26,880
Officer Pu,

381
00:32:28,119 --> 00:32:30,839
and you are an officer
sent by the imperial court,

382
00:32:31,799 --> 00:32:33,279
I'll report this matter

383
00:32:34,799 --> 00:32:36,400
to the General

384
00:32:36,920 --> 00:32:38,440
and ask him to come see you.

385
00:32:42,440 --> 00:32:44,119
But in this written account,

386
00:32:44,640 --> 00:32:46,440
those first five characters,

387
00:32:47,440 --> 00:32:49,480
"Commander-in-Chief of Gansu,"

388
00:32:50,480 --> 00:32:52,359
I, Ha Bingzhong,

389
00:32:52,839 --> 00:32:54,640
dare not write any further.

390
00:33:05,759 --> 00:33:07,160
I'll wait right here.

391
00:34:10,460 --> 00:34:12,260
(Commander-in-Chief of Gansu)

392
00:34:19,800 --> 00:34:21,320
Why are there so many men?

393
00:34:21,840 --> 00:34:23,600
Vice General Li
just arrived from Suzhou.

394
00:34:23,610 --> 00:34:25,600
He heard that the officer
from the imperial court

395
00:34:25,616 --> 00:34:27,360
was nearly assassinated
on the drill ground.

396
00:34:28,519 --> 00:34:29,840
Where is Vice General Li?

397
00:34:30,016 --> 00:34:30,960
On the drill ground.

398
00:34:31,360 --> 00:34:32,599
He wants to see the General.

399
00:34:37,239 --> 00:34:40,199
I don't know
if the General is awake yet.

400
00:35:06,280 --> 00:35:07,159
General Ha.

401
00:35:09,800 --> 00:35:11,280
Everything was going well.

402
00:35:11,880 --> 00:35:13,559
Now we can't leave.

403
00:35:15,088 --> 00:35:17,744
What case is the Embroidered Uniform
Guard officer investigating?

404
00:35:20,960 --> 00:35:22,480
Why is Vice General Li here?

405
00:35:22,490 --> 00:35:25,270
The Commander-in-Chief hasn't left
the inner courtyard for three months.

406
00:35:25,280 --> 00:35:26,360
I came to check on him.

407
00:35:27,800 --> 00:35:29,599
Why did you bring so many men?

408
00:35:29,960 --> 00:35:31,239
They're part of Suzhou's defenses

409
00:35:31,960 --> 00:35:33,119
and traveled here with me.

410
00:36:22,679 --> 00:36:23,920
What's so special about her?

411
00:36:30,480 --> 00:36:31,400
Yes.

412
00:36:32,639 --> 00:36:34,960
I've never met anyone crazier than you.

413
00:36:35,639 --> 00:36:36,679
You couldn't do it?

414
00:36:37,960 --> 00:36:40,920
I've never been able to resist you.

415
00:36:41,320 --> 00:36:42,159
Report!

416
00:36:44,920 --> 00:36:45,599
General Ha.

417
00:36:46,159 --> 00:36:47,199
There's a woman outside.

418
00:36:47,232 --> 00:36:49,250
She says she wants
to see the Commander-in-Chief.

419
00:36:49,400 --> 00:36:50,199
A woman?

420
00:36:50,960 --> 00:36:52,320
She says her name is Zhang Luyao.

421
00:36:53,664 --> 00:36:55,110
She wants to tell the General

422
00:36:55,136 --> 00:36:56,150
where the 300,000 taels...

423
00:36:56,159 --> 00:36:57,280
Shut your mouth.

424
00:37:00,079 --> 00:37:00,960
General Ha.

425
00:37:01,008 --> 00:37:02,130
Are you delivering medicine?

426
00:37:03,519 --> 00:37:05,199
I'll go in with General Ha.

427
00:37:05,719 --> 00:37:07,039
The General has given orders.

428
00:37:07,920 --> 00:37:09,280
Trespassers will be executed.

429
00:37:11,296 --> 00:37:13,320
What case
is the imperial court investigating?

430
00:37:19,599 --> 00:37:22,000
The Commander-in-Chief
killed for plunder

431
00:37:22,048 --> 00:37:23,590
and abused the law for personal gain.

432
00:37:24,239 --> 00:37:25,320
Nonsense.

433
00:37:25,632 --> 00:37:27,568
Where is
the Embroidered Uniform Guard officer?

434
00:37:27,600 --> 00:37:28,710
In the accounting office.

435
00:37:29,960 --> 00:37:30,840
Vice General Li,

436
00:37:30,960 --> 00:37:32,119
you can ask him yourself.

437
00:37:46,280 --> 00:37:48,159
Bring that woman in.

438
00:37:49,960 --> 00:37:51,280
Take her to the drill ground?

439
00:37:51,800 --> 00:37:53,239
Take her to see the General.

440
00:37:53,480 --> 00:37:55,000
I'll wait for her in the front hall.

441
00:37:55,960 --> 00:37:56,599
Yes.

442
00:38:06,559 --> 00:38:08,519
That woman may enter.

443
00:38:10,000 --> 00:38:11,079
As for everyone else,

444
00:38:11,840 --> 00:38:13,400
trespassers will be executed.

445
00:38:13,584 --> 00:38:15,150
What if Vice General Li tries to enter?

446
00:38:16,519 --> 00:38:17,280
Execute him.

447
00:38:18,039 --> 00:38:18,800
Yes.

448
00:38:52,832 --> 00:38:54,320
The General requests your presence.

449
00:39:00,719 --> 00:39:02,480
I should've killed her just now.

450
00:39:03,800 --> 00:39:06,599
She won't make it out alive anyway.

451
00:39:07,599 --> 00:39:09,039
You still can't bear to kill her.

452
00:39:11,719 --> 00:39:12,519
Yes.

453
00:39:17,440 --> 00:39:18,519
Make way!

454
00:39:41,079 --> 00:39:41,880
Open the gate.

455
00:40:00,020 --> 00:40:04,980
(May Divine Might Protect Us Forever)

456
00:40:51,039 --> 00:40:52,400
Zhang Luyao.

457
00:40:54,639 --> 00:40:55,400
Yes.

458
00:40:57,000 --> 00:40:57,679
Speak.

459
00:40:58,639 --> 00:40:59,599
About what?

460
00:41:00,360 --> 00:41:02,159
The 300,000 taels of gold...

461
00:41:02,760 --> 00:41:04,000
Where is it buried?

462
00:41:22,840 --> 00:41:24,039
You are

463
00:41:24,840 --> 00:41:26,159
the Commander-in-Chief?

464
00:41:41,199 --> 00:41:41,880
Yes.

465
00:41:47,199 --> 00:41:48,199
Do you have any water?

466
00:41:49,599 --> 00:41:50,719
I'm very thirsty.

467
00:42:02,760 --> 00:42:03,760
Wait here.

468
00:42:26,360 --> 00:42:28,039
This is all for Officer Pu?

469
00:42:29,519 --> 00:42:30,400
It's not a gift.

470
00:42:30,559 --> 00:42:31,639
It's a bribe.

471
00:42:32,480 --> 00:42:33,239
Why?

472
00:42:33,248 --> 00:42:35,030
I'm waiting here
for the Commander-in-Chief.

473
00:42:35,039 --> 00:42:36,800
When he comes, you'll know why.

474
00:42:37,920 --> 00:42:40,784
The Commander-in-Chief hasn't left
the inner courtyard for three months.

475
00:42:41,679 --> 00:42:42,880
He still has to come.

476
00:42:43,480 --> 00:42:44,960
He killed civilians in Liangzhou,

477
00:42:44,960 --> 00:42:46,920
27 members of the Zhang family.

478
00:42:48,719 --> 00:42:49,679
The Zhang family?

479
00:42:52,840 --> 00:42:54,719
There's a woman on the drill ground

480
00:42:55,000 --> 00:42:56,119
named Zhang Luyao.

481
00:42:56,120 --> 00:42:57,728
She wants to see the Commander-in-Chief.

482
00:43:09,820 --> 00:43:12,260
(Preview of the Next Episode)

483
00:43:13,079 --> 00:43:14,119
The General is dead.

484
00:43:14,400 --> 00:43:15,719
The General is dead!

485
00:43:22,239 --> 00:43:24,599
- General!
- General!

486
00:43:28,159 --> 00:43:30,639
Zhang Luyao is dead.

487
00:43:31,159 --> 00:43:32,800
Wusu Sea lies to the north.

488
00:43:32,920 --> 00:43:34,559
Do you think the gold might be there?

489
00:43:37,679 --> 00:43:38,960
My name is Tang Zheng.

490
00:43:40,281 --> 00:43:45,281
=Remnants of Gold=
